# Local development broker. On the VPS each login is narrower (a device may
# only use mower/<its username>/#, plus read
# mower/status/server); here both may use mower/#, because the integration
# tests give every test its own topic prefix (mower/it-<random>).
user app
topic readwrite mower/#

# A device (like the LTE gateway), used by the integration tests.
user test-device
topic readwrite mower/#
